00:36:43.700 --> 00:36:46.303
that may not be
strongly balanced.

00:36:46.303 --> 00:36:48.939
They're happy,
losing or gaining.

00:36:48.939 --> 00:36:50.307
And how do you know?

00:36:50.307 --> 00:36:51.208
How do you know?

00:36:51.208 --> 00:36:55.812
If you have ions, how
do you know, you know,

00:36:55.812 --> 00:36:56.713
