00:37:09.726 --> 00:37:10.961
You have a scale.

00:37:10.961 --> 00:37:12.829
That's not-- no.

00:37:12.829 --> 00:37:14.464
It's in here somewhere.

00:37:14.464 --> 00:37:18.835
You have a conductivity
meter, somewhere in here,

00:37:18.835 --> 00:37:21.271
