00:47:23.706 --> 00:47:24.974
It is a very hard material.

00:47:24.974 --> 00:47:25.608
Why?

00:47:25.608 --> 00:47:26.810
Because of this.

00:47:26.810 --> 00:47:27.811
Literally.

00:47:27.811 --> 00:47:31.447
Those Q's are
