00:47:31.447 --> 00:47:32.715
Why does this matter?

00:47:32.715 --> 00:47:36.052
Well, I'm going to give you
an example in hemodialysis.

00:47:36.052 --> 00:47:37.887
Hemodialysis is
something that people

00:47:37.887 --> 00:47:39.255
